{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What if this dream never ended? What if we could dream it together?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Reverie in the Moonlight</i> is an action game where, with the help of your stuffed animals, you try to defend yourself from the monsters attacking you night after night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nightly Visits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little Tete\u2019s nights are restless. His dreams are full of horrible monsters attacking him. But then, one night, he meets Luna, and she teaches him how to use his plushies to defend himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cute but Strong</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When faced with a monster, Tete can only do one thing: run away. His plushies, however, can actually fight and defeat monsters. Different animals play different roles, with some focusing on short-range attacks, some on long-range shots, and some on supporting their allies. There are 40 types to choose from, so find your favorites and help them protect Tete from the monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480790/extras/c0fb92c68ca4dfa915ce4bade333168e.webp?t=1762747880\" width=56 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Ham Jr.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs left and right, hitting monsters that get too close with a stick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480790/extras/90f7ab1f2c0092b11a9e9f57609ff46f.avif?t=1762747880\" width=65 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Snoozy-G</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoys sleeping, napping, and resting. Monsters that hit it are slowed down for a while.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480790/extras/e74832955aefab6b890edf0c6a37b9e6.avif?t=1762747880\" width=65 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Striped Angel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When it sees someone in trouble, it always wants to help. It heals Tete up from a distance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect and Strategize</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the monsters\u2019 attack is over, you can shop with the gold you found. You can get new plushies and even buy special items that can make you stronger. Some of them will also give you new weaknesses, so it\u2019s up to you to strategize and prepare for the next attack in the best way possible. There are more than 100 items in the game... Will you be able to collect them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Change Clothes to Change Strategies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, you\u2019ve played the game\u2019s story to the end. Well done. But this is just the start!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can change Tete\u2019s clothes, choosing from more than 20 costumes. Each one makes him stronger in some ways and weaker in others. If you want to help Tete defeat his nightmares, you\u2019ll have to find the right plushies and items to go with each costume!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480790/extras/5e4f0d8b8e68b4dedc632657ad234ad5.webp?t=1762747880\" width=60 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Moonlight Wizard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plushies with long-range attacks become stronger, but Tete can only use those. Defending yourself becomes harder, so you\u2019ll have to defeat monsters before they can get close.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480790/extras/6b5eb3d12db1d673b4ff54087392d709.webp?t=1762747880\" width=60 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Nap Cloud</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing attack power becomes difficult, but plushies that don\u2019t move around attack twice as fast. Try to find as many stationary friends as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480790/extras/378fd0b0f4d6e644acfd84fc44a6462b.webp?t=1762747880\" width=60 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Doggy Friend</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tete can only use dog plushies. If you want to win, you\u2019ll need to make good use of their fast respawn speed.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Failure","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3480790/7edd7289a9c60da0f69cd330fdc326946a74e19b.jpg"},{"name":"Beginner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3480790/03700771446c6a16f1a89660313dd531484c7dad.jpg"},{"name":"Veteran","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3480790/3e4c139a23a84d3da4fb2cdb5e00cc108055bb8b.jpg"},{"name":"Professional","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3480790/6035c2594aec218779daa375efdbd6d9b549e945.jpg"},{"name":"Easy Pajama","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3480790/97d14f6b089c2e7c256ae2bb225a6282c5a02590.jpg"},{"name":"Ghost Beginner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3480790/a842b5ea143831ffb0e1c30eaa9d50bd727d891d.jpg"},{"name":"Haunt Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3480790/60ef5a9d49e0b2039cfac4c0837a5ac946349c91.jpg"},{"name":"Specter Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3480790/283ad2fdbf40d5a070bdcc106efdf9ee1c017b89.jpg"},{"name":"Nightmare Vanquisher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3480790/f07f5e016af4fcca9b8d0f771dc5e87cf3882a04.jpg"},{"name":"Easy Swordsman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3480790/28558c0caaa1dc1f22dd4d69400bb60bce7a2f9b.jpg"}],"total":110},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3480790?t=1762747880","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480790/a1f59214894a9297499a98e5591f5aa47b35ee95/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762747880","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480790/9e3218dac74c442947027b274d3f5e3cbf86fd2c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762747880","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480790/9e3218dac74c442947027b274d3f5e3cbf86fd2c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762747880","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3641960,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What if this dream never ended? What if we could dream it together?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Reverie in the Moonlight</i> is an action game where, with the help of your stuffed animals, you try to defend yourself from the monsters attacking you night after night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nightly Visits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little Tete\u2019s nights are restless. His dreams are full of horrible monsters attacking him. But then, one night, he meets Luna, and she teaches him how to use his plushies to defend himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cute but Strong</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When faced with a monster, Tete can only do one thing: run away. His plushies, however, can actually fight and defeat monsters. Different animals play different roles, with some focusing on short-range attacks, some on long-range shots, and some on supporting their allies. There are 40 types to choose from, so find your favorites and help them protect Tete from the monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480790/extras/c0fb92c68ca4dfa915ce4bade333168e.webp?t=1762747880\" width=56 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Ham Jr.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs left and right, hitting monsters that get too close with a stick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480790/extras/90f7ab1f2c0092b11a9e9f57609ff46f.avif?t=1762747880\" width=65 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Snoozy-G</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoys sleeping, napping, and resting. Monsters that hit it are slowed down for a while.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480790/extras/e74832955aefab6b890edf0c6a37b9e6.avif?t=1762747880\" width=65 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Striped Angel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When it sees someone in trouble, it always wants to help. It heals Tete up from a distance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect and Strategize</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the monsters\u2019 attack is over, you can shop with the gold you found. You can get new plushies and even buy special items that can make you stronger. Some of them will also give you new weaknesses, so it\u2019s up to you to strategize and prepare for the next attack in the best way possible. There are more than 100 items in the game... Will you be able to collect them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Change Clothes to Change Strategies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, you\u2019ve played the game\u2019s story to the end. Well done. But this is just the start!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can change Tete\u2019s clothes, choosing from more than 20 costumes. Each one makes him stronger in some ways and weaker in others. If you want to help Tete defeat his nightmares, you\u2019ll have to find the right plushies and items to go with each costume!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480790/extras/5e4f0d8b8e68b4dedc632657ad234ad5.webp?t=1762747880\" width=60 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Moonlight Wizard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plushies with long-range attacks become stronger, but Tete can only use those. Defending yourself becomes harder, so you\u2019ll have to defeat monsters before they can get close.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480790/extras/6b5eb3d12db1d673b4ff54087392d709.webp?t=1762747880\" width=60 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Nap Cloud</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing attack power becomes difficult, but plushies that don\u2019t move around attack twice as fast. Try to find as many stationary friends as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480790/extras/378fd0b0f4d6e644acfd84fc44a6462b.webp?t=1762747880\" width=60 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Doggy Friend</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tete can only use dog plushies. If you want to win, you\u2019ll need to make good use of their fast respawn speed.</p>","developers":["room6"],"dlc":[4096980],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480790/6751ac3b60b3050de7dfa572761fbf6f0b8f15d9/header.jpg?t=1762747880","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3480790/1361063287/549c73e0b9d63ae3cbbd20c2a74902b923077be9/1750854730/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749175280","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3480790/1361063287/549c73e0b9d63ae3cbbd20c2a74902b923077be9/1750854730/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749175280","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3480790/1361063287/549c73e0b9d63ae3cbbd20c2a74902b923077be9/1750854730/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749175280","id":257150337,"name":"Reverie_in_the_Moonlight","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a