 the Moonlight, scary monsters are chasing you, and you can\u2019t fight them...but your plushies can. Can your adorable friends protect you from these nightmares?","steam_appid":3480790,"support_info":{"email":"","url":"https://www.room6.net/contact"},"supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese","type":"game","website":null}